## 7. Action Plan for a Complete Beginner
```markdown
Day 1: Choose Med Spa or Dental clinic industry.
Day 2: Build "Missed Call Text-Back + AI Qualification Bot" on Make.com.
Day 3: Create 90-second Loom demo of the bot.
Day 4: Find 100 dental clinics on Apollo.io.
Day 5: Send 20 personalized outreach emails per day.
Day 7+: Schedule demos and close first client.
```

